# Font Files

Download and place font files here:

## Rubik
- Rubik-Regular.ttf
- Rubik-Medium.ttf
- Rubik-SemiBold.ttf
- Rubik-Bold.ttf

Download from: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Rubik

## Space Grotesk
- SpaceGrotesk-Regular.ttf
- SpaceGrotesk-Medium.ttf
- SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold.ttf
- SpaceGrotesk-Bold.ttf

Download from: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Space+Grotesk

## Usage

After downloading, update app/_layout.tsx to use local fonts:
```typescript
const [fontsLoaded] = useFonts({
  'Rubik-Regular': require('../assets/fonts/Rubik-Regular.ttf'),
  // ... etc
});
```
